# Language Test 202505 - ABC086C: Traveling
Sonome kas N tas Kisite kas readint.
Sonome kas previous_t tas 0.
Sonome kas previous_x tas 0.
Sonome kas previous_y tas 0.
Sonome kas ok tas Tuni.
Sonome kas t tas 0.
Sonome kas x tas 0.
Sonome kas y tas 0.
Sonome kas dt tas 0.
Sonome kas distance tas 0.
Sonome kas values tas [0, 0, 0].
Pilike kas i pas Kisite kas pilika vis N {
    Kemese kas values tas Kisite kas readints vis 3.
    Kemese kas t tas values[0].
    Kemese kas x tas values[1].
    Kemese kas y tas values[2].
    Kemese kas dt tas t - previous_t.
    Kemese kas distance tas (Kisite kas abs vis x - previous_x) + (Kisite kas abs vis y - previous_y).
    Palusta distance > dt vista (dt - distance) % 2 != 0 {
        Kemese kas ok tas Jatuni.
    }
    Kemese kas previous_t tas t.
    Kemese kas previous_x tas x.
    Kemese kas previous_y tas y.
}
Palusta ok {
    Takute kas "Yes".
} Japalusta {
    Takute kas "No".
}
